                "caption": "Figure 1:Given the same seed, DWD preserves similar content to the original model while improving fine detail.(a)On latent-space video diffusion, DWD removes the decoder and keeps text rendering legible across frames, whereas the baseline distorts it.(b)On pixel-space image diffusion, DWD recovers photorealistic skin and hair texture that the baseline oversmooths.",
